# Build artifacts
/target
site/
# graphify knowledge-graph output: regenerable, never committed to develop/main.
# `graphify-out/*` rather than `graphify-out/` so a branch that tracks a snapshot
# can still re-include files with `!` (a directory-level ignore cannot be negated).
graphify-out/*

